Modifications: safetensors index filtering; SM80 byte-preserving PLE lookup;
SM80 skinny GEMM compatibility and dispatch; finalized Mamba cache block size;
optional all-reduce dispatch and launch geometry; CPU-cache scratch-group
projection. See patches/ for exact diffs.

The model weights and container image are not distributed by this repository.
The model has its own Qwen Community 1.0 license; the cookbook's Apache license
does not relicense model weights or model-generated answers. The book fixtures
come from Project Gutenberg; their original text and license headers
remain in the compressed fixtures and extracted raw files. Recorded generated answers are evaluation
artifacts, not authoritative editions of the book.

The Earthrise image and its derivatives in benchmarks/fixtures/vision/ are
based on the NASA / Bill Anders public-domain Apollo 8 photograph. Original
source, hashes, and explicitly identified test alterations are documented
with the fixtures.
